Subject: [PATCH 2496/3799] soh: rename func_800F4010 -> Audio_PlayWalkSfx

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: scales the sfx by the speed and may add a second randomised sound; its only caller passes the player's floorSfxOffset from the camera, so the walking reading comes from that caller rather than from the body
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_general.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
